    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game may trigger seizures for those with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stolen Life</strong></i> is a psychological horror game designed to immerse you in a tense and unsettling atmosphere. After hearing a mysterious scream, you discover a hidden, unfamiliar part of your own home. As you explore this strange new area, secrets begin to unravel, and you realize your wife has disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Piece together clues, uncover hidden truths, and search for your missing wife while facing the growing fear of what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a series of interconnected rooms and hidden passages within your home. Each area is filled with environmental storytelling and subtle hints that guide you closer to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> Encounter a variety of puzzles that range from logic-based challenges to more abstract, psychological tests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Experience a blend of psychological and environmental horror. The game uses sound, lighting, and visual effects to create a constant sense of unease and tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Uncover a rich, layered story through found documents, environmental clues, and eerie encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> The game features a first-person perspective, realistic graphics, and a haunting soundtrack that together create a deeply immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485350/extras/08ca90cdde50a7b683b40276cfd545e0.poster.avif?t=1743788484\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485350/extras/08ca90cdde50a7b683b40276cfd545e0.webm?t=1743788484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485350/extras/08ca90cdde50a7b683b40276cfd545e0.mp4?t=1743788484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience:</strong><br>A psychological thriller that blends mystery and horror, keeping you on edge as reality and fear intertwine. The game challenges your nerves and perception, offering an intense, immersive experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game may trigger seizures for those with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stolen Life</strong></i> is a psychological horror game designed to immerse you in a tense and unsettling atmosphere. After hearing a mysterious scream, you discover a hidden, unfamiliar part of your own home. As you explore this strange new area, secrets begin to unravel, and you realize your wife has disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Piece together clues, uncover hidden truths, and search for your missing wife while facing the growing fear of what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a series of interconnected rooms and hidden passages within your home. Each area is filled with environmental storytelling and subtle hints that guide you closer to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> Encounter a variety of puzzles that range from logic-based challenges to more abstract, psychological tests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Experience a blend of psychological and environmental horror. The game uses sound, lighting, and visual effects to create a constant sense of unease and tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Uncover a rich, layered story through found documents, environmental clues, and eerie encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> The game features a fir